flowchart LR
  G[Staged source changes] --> I[Deterministic dependency scan]
  I --> P[Read-only Strands Planner / Nova Lite]
  P --> X[Codex edits allowlisted prose in isolation]
  X --> V[Tests + unchanged source/index checks]
  V --> R[Separate read-only coding-agent review]
  R --> H[Hash-bound receipt + ledger]
  H --> C[PR deterministic and conflict checks]
  C --> T[Committed trust table]
  R -->|Unresolved claims| B[Refuse trust]
